                       What does this door do?


I wanted to make a requestdoor coz I couldn't find any fast & good!
In my search for a good requestdoor i found that VD-request was the
best around, the only problem with that door is that it's made in 
slow Arexx.

The door was coded in C using SasC 6.51 Development kit. The main code 
has been created by fanta & Aquarius. Static has made the dezign.

It has been coded to be fully multinode. 

